title: 'maybe obvious : some kinds of atoms'
pid: f3a05647-e9f9-49ad-9050-e6582047bf66
body: |2-
  Stories can be atoms that can be broken down into smaller atoms.
  The topics a story illustrates can be atoms.
  Relationships (e.g. "x is funny") can be atoms.
  Anything that can be named can be an atom.
  A web of concepts, each an atom, can be built to unite all the atoms
  (many of which, e.g. stories, are not concepts).
